WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.630
(phone vibrating)

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:38.540
Hey, man! 

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.540
(alarm going off)

00:00:53.750 --> 00:01:01.250
All of the sudden this like, Japanese tap gang walked in. And like, the crowd totally stopped. And they hit the stage. 

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:08.130
They were like peeling off their clothes as they were going to the stage, putting on their tap shoes, and then they had a tap dance batt--

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.040
They had like a tap dance battle.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:35.630
So I the Hollywood d-bag, "Look, it's a bike lane!"

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:44.380
And what he does, he pulls out a briefcase-- what looks like a million dollars, I swear. He hands me $40,000 just to fix my bike. 

